---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Anim from "../../components/Anim.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="@open-rgs/pay-lines  - Runs along a line"
  description="Pay-lines: Longest run, paid once."
>
  <main>
    <p class="dim"><a href="/extension">&larr; extensions</a></p>
    <h1>@open-rgs/pay-lines</h1>

    <p class="lede">Longest run, paid once.</p>

    <Anim kind="pay-lines" caption="A run must start at the leftmost reel. Under bothWays the two directions COMPETE rather than accumulate, or a full-width run is counted twice." />

    <p>Paying every prefix - 3 of a kind AND 4 AND 5 on the same run - roughly doubles a game's RTP. A wild-opening run is ambiguous and pays whichever reading is worth more. And a wild never substitutes for a scatter, or it manufactures feature triggers.</p>

    <h2 data-section="&sect;">Reach for</h2>
    <pre><code>{`import { ... } from "@open-rgs/pay-lines";`}</code></pre>
    <p class="dim">evalLine  &middot;  evalLines  &middot;  rowLines(5, 3)  &middot;  &#123; bothWays: true &#125;</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
